07382200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "178648493", "author": {"steamid": "76561198822441106", "personaname": "Nikoon", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198822441106/", "num_games_owned": 257, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 5869, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 217, "playtime_at_review": 1691, "last_played": 1787289938, "avatar": "fb293bbac4dfbbd98a85fa04dbbd98ad8395d394"}, "language": "english", "review": "for a game called Helldivers, the hell you'll experience is still startling. this is a game worth all the praise it gets, minus the Sony part, and I can not overstate the fun you can have playing it.\n\nyou probably already know what the game is so I'll just state information you would actually care about.\n\n1) the game is best enjoyed with friends\n2) the game is easy to play at whatever pace you can handle, and in some cases playing on the lower difficulties actually gets you more progress on defending or capturing planets.\n3) the game is entirely accessible to F2P (free to play) players as all of the warbonds in game can be purchased just by collecting the premium currency from the free war bond you start the game with.\n4) you will die, a lot. this does not make you bad at the game, it makes you a good soldier.\nand make no mistake, democracy is the key to victory.", "timestamp_created": 1731108254, "timestamp_updated": 1731108319, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178648457", "author": {"steamid": "76561199535098883", "personaname": "Reddishwriter14", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199535098883/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews":